            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kosodi kanen enyamete, kobu akirot naka EJAKAIT mama ejai enabi loabu kinyaku ŋes: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiworo mama ejai etuŋanan laka Edeke loabunit koYuda ebe, “Inera EJAKAIT kwanata ebe, ‘Naarai ipaliiki ijo akirot naka EJAKAIT, mam irieit aicorakinet naeeoraki EJAKAIT Ekonideke jo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Konye ibonu, inyama atap, imat akipi kaibois nakilimokinio jo ebe, “Sirikinyam atap, sirikimat akipi”; mam akuanakon idaikinio ates naka lukapapaakon.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kosodi kanen kedau ŋesi ainyam atap, ka aimat, kopesik lupetan asigiria enabi loenyakuni ŋesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.23"
            ]
          }
        },
