        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kepupu ŋun enabi loabu kinyaku ŋes korot, kotema atiar, “Ŋes ŋol etuŋanan loka Edeke, loabu kipaliik akirot naka EJAKAIT: kanuka nun eiaiki EJAKAIT ŋes mama ejai eŋatuny, loapoopoo ŋes, aara da, kwape ajaar akirot naka EJAKAIT, naabu kiner kaŋes.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
